{"item_uid": "指考98-biology-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "biology", "subject_zh": "生物", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 2, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "細菌DNA分子複製時，培養基中若含有 N15的鹼基，則 N15會被合成入DNA中。一科學家將細菌\n在 N15的培養基中繁殖很多代後，再接種於含 N14的新培養基中培養。下列有關細菌在新培養基\n中進行細胞分裂的敘述，何者正確？", "options": {"A": "經過一次分裂後，1/4的細菌具有 N15的DNA", "B": "經過一次分裂後，半數的細菌具有 N15的DNA", "C": "經過二次分裂後，1/4的細菌具有 N15的DNA", "D": "經過二次分裂後，半數的細菌具有 N15的DNA"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 44.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 81.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 7.0, "B": 25.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 13.0}, "omit_rate": 19.0, "p_value": 44.0, "p_high": 81.0, "p_low": 13.0, "discrimination": 68.0, "p_quintiles": [88.0, 65.0, 36.0, 18.0, 12.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
