{"item_uid": "指考98-biology-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "biology", "subject_zh": "生物", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "許多節肢動物幼蟲的頭部堅硬無比，使幼蟲必須蛻掉舊頭殼才能長大，每蛻一次皮稱為增加一\n齡。有一種毛蟲一生要蛻皮五次才化蛹，生物學家發現可以利用Ln Y=0.387 X−0.517的公式來\n推算毛蟲的齡數。根據這項公式，三齡幼蟲的頭殼寬度最接近下列哪一數值？（Y為頭殼寬；X\n為幼蟲齡數；Ln為自然對數；Ln 1.3≒0.26，Ln 1.9≒0.64，Ln 2.8≒1.03，Ln 4.1≒1.41）", "options": {"A": "1.3 mm", "B": "1.9 mm", "C": "2.8 mm", "D": "4.1 mm\n- 1 -\n98年指考 第 2 頁\n生物考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 2.0, "B": 81.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 93.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 4.0, "B": 64.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 7.0}, "omit_rate": 8.0, "p_value": 81.0, "p_high": 93.0, "p_low": 64.0, "discrimination": 29.0, "p_quintiles": [95.0, 91.0, 87.0, 79.0, 55.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-biology-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "biology", "subject_zh": "生物", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "有甲、乙、丙三種植物，其花的特徵如表 表 1\n1。根據表1資料，下列有關這三種植物傳 植物種類\n花的特徵\n播花粉方式的推論，哪一選項正確？ 甲 乙 丙", "options": {"A": "都是風媒花 花瓣顏色 白色 紫色 黃色", "B": "都是蟲媒花 花瓣大小 0.3 cm 10 cm 4 cm", "C": "甲為風媒花，乙和丙為蟲媒花 氣味 無 強烈腐臭味 濃香味\n甲和乙為風媒花，丙為蟲媒花 糖蜜分泌量 無 中等 大量", "D": ""}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 0.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 84.0, "D": 13.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 94.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 0.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 71.0, "D": 22.0}, "omit_rate": 2.0, "p_value": 84.0, "p_high": 94.0, "p_low": 71.0, "discrimination": 23.0, "p_quintiles": [95.0, 92.0, 88.0, 81.0, 65.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
